---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import WhatsappWidget from '../../../components/WhatsappWidget.astro';
import FAQ from '../../../components/FAQ.astro';
import posts from '../../../../blog-posts.json';

const post = posts.find(p => p.slug === 'seo-pricing-pakistan-2026');
const title = 'SEO Pricing in Pakistan 2026: How Much Do SEO Services Cost? | SEO Ustaad';
const description = 'Transparent SEO pricing guide for Pakistani businesses. Compare local SEO, technical SEO, ecommerce SEO, and monthly retainer costs across Karachi, Lahore and Islamabad.';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://www.seoustaad.com/blog/seo-pricing-pakistan/';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}>
  <Header slot="header" />

  <section class="py-5" style="padding-top:140px!important;background:var(--bg-dark)">
    <div class="container py-4">
      <a href="/blog/" class="text-orange text-decoration-none small mb-3 d-inline-block">&larr; Back to Blog</a>
      <article>
        <header class="mb-5">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="badge bg-transparent border border-secondary text-secondary small px-3 py-2">2026-07-28</span>
            <span class="text-orange small fw-semibold">{post ? post.category : 'Guide'}</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="outfit display-4 fw-bold text-white mb-4">{post ? post.title : title}</h1>
          <p class="lead text-gray" style="max-width:800px">{post ? post.excerpt : description}</p>
        </header>

        <div class="text-gray" style="max-width:850px;line-height:1.9;font-size:1.05rem">
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">Understanding SEO Pricing in Pakistan</h2>
        <p>SEO pricing in Pakistan varies significantly based on the scope of work, competitiveness of your industry, and the agency's expertise. Unlike paid advertising where costs are predictable, SEO is an investment in organic visibility that compounds over time.

In 2026, the Pakistani SEO market has matured. Prices range from PKR 15,000/month for basic local SEO to PKR 300,000+/month for enterprise-level campaigns. Understanding what you get at each price point is essential for making an informed decision.

At SEO Ustaad, we believe in transparent pricing. Our packages start at PKR 8,000 for specific services.</p>
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">Local SEO Pricing (PKR 8,000 - 25,000/month)</h2>
        <p><strong>Basic Local SEO (PKR 8,000 - 15,000/month):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Google Business Profile optimization and management</li>
<li>Local citation building (10-20 directories)</li>
<li>Basic keyword tracking (5-10 local keywords)</li>
<li>Monthly performance report</li>
</ul>

<strong>Advanced Local SEO (PKR 15,000 - 25,000/month):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Everything in basic, plus:</li>
<li>Review generation and reputation management</li>
<li>Geo-targeted landing page creation</li>
<li>Local content creation (2-4 posts/month)</li>
<li>Competitor analysis</li>
</ul>

Compare with our <a href="/services/premium-local-seo-retainer/">Premium Local SEO Retainer</a>.</p>
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">Technical SEO Pricing (PKR 15,000 - 35,000)</h2>
        <p><strong>Basic Technical Audit (PKR 15,000 - 20,000):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Crawl analysis and error identification</li>
<li>Core Web Vitals assessment</li>
<li>Mobile-friendliness check</li>
<li>Basic schema markup audit</li>
</ul>

<strong>Comprehensive Technical SEO (PKR 25,000 - 35,000):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Full site crawl with Screaming Frog</li>
<li>Complete schema markup implementation</li>
<li>Core Web Vitals optimization</li>
<li>XML sitemap and robots.txt optimization</li>
<li>Internal linking audit and restructure</li>
</ul>

Our <a href="/services/premium-technical-seo-audit/">Premium Technical SEO Audit</a> covers everything at PKR 15,000.</p>
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">Ecommerce SEO Pricing (PKR 20,000 - 50,000/month)</h2>
        <p><strong>Shopify/WooCommerce SEO (PKR 20,000 - 35,000/month):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Product page optimization (up to 50 products)</li>
<li>Category page optimization</li>
<li>Technical ecommerce SEO</li>
<li>Blog content strategy and creation</li>
</ul>

<strong>Enterprise Ecommerce SEO (PKR 35,000 - 50,000+/month):</strong>
<ul>
<li>Large catalog optimization (500+ products)</li>
<li>Link building and digital PR</li>
<li>International SEO (multiple countries)</li>
<li>Dedicated account manager</li>
</ul>

Explore our <a href="/services/premium-ecommerce-seo-services/">Premium E-Commerce SEO Services</a>.</p>
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">Content Marketing Costs</h2>
        <p><strong>Blog Posts (1,000-2,000 words):</strong> PKR 3,000 - 8,000 per post

<strong>Pillar Pages (2,500-5,000 words):</strong> PKR 10,000 - 20,000 per page

<strong>Content Clusters (5-10 interlinked posts):</strong> PKR 25,000 - 60,000 per cluster

<strong>Case Studies:</strong> PKR 8,000 - 15,000 per case study</p>
        <h2 class="h4 fw-bold text-white mt-5 mb-3">What Factors Affect SEO Pricing?</h2>
        <p>Several factors determine the final cost of SEO services:

<ul>
<li><strong>Competition Level</strong> — competitive industries require more investment</li>
<li><strong>Target Keywords</strong> — high-volume keywords need more content and links</li>
<li><strong>Website Size</strong> — larger sites require more optimization work</li>
<li><strong>Agency Expertise</strong> — experienced agencies charge premium rates</li>
<li><strong>Geographic Scope</strong> — local SEO is cheaper than national/international</li>
</ul>

<strong>The Bottom Line:</strong> If an SEO package seems too cheap, it probably is. Quality SEO requires skilled professionals, tools, and time.</p>

          <div class="mt-5 p-4 rounded-4" style="background:var(--surface-dark);border:1px solid rgba(255,102,0,0.2)">
            <h3 class="h5 fw-bold text-white mb-2">Ready to Grow Your Business?</h3>
            <p class="mb-3">Get transparent, results-driven SEO. Explore our <a href="/services/premium-technical-seo-audit/">Technical SEO Audit</a> or <a href="/services/complete-onpage-seo-optimization/">On-Page SEO</a> packages.</p>
            <p class="small text-gray mb-0">Contact SEO Ustaad on <a href="https://wa.me/923146348900" class="text-orange">WhatsApp</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@seoustaad.com" class="text-orange">support@seoustaad.com</a> for a free consultation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5" style="max-width:850px">
          <FAQ category="general" />
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
  <WhatsappWidget slot="widget" />
</Layout>
